\label{tab:sdgd-cal-maven}
\begin{tabular}{lrrr}
\toprule
Method & Relaxed F1 & $k$ & Calibration(s) \\
\midrule
Single-pass    & 0.247 & 1  & 0   \\
Random         & 0.175 & 12 & 0   \\
SDGD-zero      & 0.135 & 8  & 0   \\
SDGD-cal (5)   & 0.165 & 10 & 200 \\
